# M11 "Künye", flow "dodge" run 2 (PostgreSQL test database only): the level-10 rogue of run 1 puts all
# 27 points into Çeviklik (automation `statadd`, then Onayla: 40 Çeviklik = 16 % dodge), walks next
# to a Kül Çömezi and lets it attack without fighting back until one of its blows is dodged: a grey
# "Iska" over the rogue and "Kaçındın!". Not strictly deterministic (the server's RNG is seeded, but
# real-time timing decides which roll a blow gets); at 16 % a dodge within the first 30 blows is
# all but certain (0.84^30 < 0.6 %), and the rogue (260 hp, a blow takes ~2-5) survives far longer.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m11_dodge
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+statsknown+monsters 1800
expect world+level10+unspent27
scene expectattr ceviklik 13 0
scene expectderived dodge 5.2
key c
waitfor world+kunye 60
scene statadd ceviklik 27
scene expectpending ceviklik 27
scene expectpreview dodge 16
scene expectpreview crit 28.5
clickon kunye.confirm
waitfor world+modal 60
clickon messagebox.button0
waitfor world+allocated1+statidle+nopending 600
scene expectattr ceviklik 40 0
scene expectderived dodge 16
key c
waitfor world+kunyeclosed 60
# ---- Stand next to a Kül Çömezi and let it attack ----
scene walktomonster Kül Çömezi 2.2
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
waitfor world+incombat 1800
scene camera side 24 6
waitfor world+dodged1 7200
wait 2
screenshot 01_dodge_iska.png
scene expectcombatmessage Kaçındın
scene combatlog
# Now fight back.
scene target nearest Kül Çömezi
scene attack
waitfor world+kills1 3000
quit
